    "updated_at": "2019-07-05T11:28:46Z",
    "body": "All browsers (but Servo, I expect), log `disconnected` only once in this test-case:\r\n\r\n```html\r\n<!doctype html>\r\n<div id=\"custom-element-parent\">\r\n  <custom-element></custom-element>\r\n</div>\r\n<script>\r\ncustomElements.define('custom-element', class extends HTMLElement {\r\n  disconnectedCallback() {\r\n    console.log(\"disconnected\");\r\n  }\r\n});\r\nonload = function() {\r\n  const p = document.getElementById(\"custom-element-parent\");\r\n  p.remove();\r\n  setTimeout(() => p.firstElementChild.remove(), 100);\r\n}\r\n</script>\r\n```",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
