    "updated_at": "2019-07-05T16:02:46Z",
    "body": "Blame for this points to when this got added. It seems the fix here would be to create a boolean before this step that stores whether _parent_ is https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#connected. And then modify this step and the subsequent step for queueing this specific callback to be conditional upon that boolean. I suspect we don't need new tests.\r\n\r\ncc @domenic ",
